            <div xml:id="m-16448899-d4c9-44af-aa1e-be778bee952f">
              <lg xml:id="m-9da6e2b5-4e29-4c44-b4ee-f2c0f8e0882d">
                <l xml:id="m-504315f6-f73d-4113-8e35-54015c2c8f21" facs="#m-2f2b9a89-8dfb-4f08-9486-860be7627447" label="ambiguous">1214</l><l xml:id="m-e640d273-ed0d-42a7-9afd-e58648d098c0" facs="#m-daf671b9-0d74-400a-b882-6e96ac7d762b" label="text-like">Common of Virgins. Vespers.</l><l xml:id="m-27358bb2-ed76-4597-81fc-56ecd5895147" facs="#m-9126d116-ee04-4612-bef9-7612928551eb" label="lyrics-like">qui a mórtu-is Surréxit, ac Pa-rá-cli-to, In sempitérna</l><l xml:id="m-0b0730a7-dcba-4c03-9f63-f3f34f63aaec" facs="#m-43b2e067-9c70-49de-aab1-35bc882e0c69" label="lyrics-like">saécula. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-75712a7c-2317-49d8-b113-3b12f0fa04f4" facs="#m-fb223206-2cbe-4cdd-bd2c-d344c03849b4" label="lyrics-like">From the Ascension to Pentecost, the following doxology is said : Jésu</l><l xml:id="m-72be5c2e-d3ca-4231-a29f-a042e2210c0e" facs="#m-fafd15a2-e50a-44a4-930c-8a6a45a53c70" label="lyrics-like">tibi sit glória, Qui victor in caélum rédis, Cum Pâtre et álmo Spiritu,</l><l xml:id="m-ebf12478-af9e-4bcf-b7e4-fbe43ade64a5" facs="#m-567fd201-05fe-4be8-9682-e88a4ecd8dd4" label="lyrics-like">In sempitérna saécula. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-0de23333-12f3-4887-988f-27678080f6f0" facs="#m-a9bb3f82-8517-47fe-b41d-d123bf20d6f6" label="lyrics-like">v. Diffúsa est grátia in lábiis túis. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-90f7a05d-55d1-4cb2-bf6c-509f491a6ecf" facs="#m-e33bcc18-a73e-4afc-b1eb-829d046dfde6" label="lyrics-like">K. Proptérea benedixit te Déus in aetérnum. (T. P. Allelúia.)</l><l xml:id="m-3eb811de-c3a1-42d0-acc4-ab8949ed9afb" facs="#m-5788b4a2-39f4-44be-9bc4-57a6ed5feba6" label="text-like">At Magn.</l><l xml:id="m-6f0aefc6-0f5a-47ae-9e90-774d3556741c" facs="#m-fcb8ea49-e8c1-4806-b9be-aabd85200f29" label="ambiguous">Ant. 7. e</l><l xml:id="m-465e3152-0cf2-44fc-8bc6-84093e8be068" facs="#m-afcc4cc2-5fa7-42d9-9817-461abf3d0a59" label="ambiguous">Y</l><l xml:id="m-b764b254-0ce1-47f3-bda5-7b600350ee99" facs="#m-4e2920df-7ff5-4cdc-ad5b-26cb65635a20" label="lyrics-like">Eni spónsa Chrísti, * áccipe corónam, quam tí¬</l><l xml:id="m-196c7f78-705b-41f0-9399-35f4af3c159e" facs="#m-e2700f07-d498-4759-9fc0-dd9b30b21468" label="lyrics-like">bi Dóminus praepa-rávit in actérnum. T. P. Alle-lú¬ia</l><l xml:id="m-98a04499-8ec8-49db-9645-db5849c7c4b2" facs="#m-659967cd-1f7f-46e0-9c23-0e9dc76273e1" label="ambiguous">E u ou a e.</l><l xml:id="m-9ceaf93f-8ade-41dd-b65f-1b2e50d4f052" facs="#m-239b7385-f32a-4855-8138-4d4b57c75305" label="lyrics-like">Cant. Magníficat 7. c. p. 211, or p. 217.</l><l xml:id="m-178cb9e0-23a0-4da7-a1c4-ecf88ab27764" facs="#m-2a90dcd5-c7e7-4787-85a8-901e5bd2c54d" label="text-like">For a Virgin Martyr. Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-b7fdf5aa-dad9-4cc8-8110-901cb4244afc" facs="#m-e3db70fa-0a2f-41e9-b147-a37bd0629a4a" label="lyrics-like">Eus, qui inter cétera poténtiae beátæ N. Virginis et Mártyris tuae</l><l xml:id="m-ba943284-48fa-45f2-9664-312cf180aa69" facs="#m-686fd4cd-b119-4e5b-8874-4c980da8f1d9" label="lyrics-like">tuae mirácula, étiam in sexu</l><l xml:id="m-db2eff10-7a45-4145-860b-1eb99c10dc83" facs="#m-90ef1a5a-7504-430c-a2e0-127ac1d640e1" label="lyrics-like">natalítia cólimus, *per eius ad te</l><l xml:id="m-f8b811ae-c8e1-46ed-a589-7e353ab1b153" facs="#m-93e14d29-a05d-4331-9cbb-a8ca2b114273" label="lyrics-like">frágili victóriam martyrii contuli¬</l><l xml:id="m-9da45d57-980c-4a45-9f57-cd75fea60fd4" facs="#m-9df2ba5e-b490-45a6-a4dd-4e1f6a780fe8" label="lyrics-like">exémpla gradiámur. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-2bcf15a7-5324-4ab8-8057-eb18d344a9c7" facs="#m-49fc075e-dd7e-41b8-abfe-3e454f128419" label="lyrics-like">sti: t concéde propstius; ut qui</l><l xml:id="m-b246e717-6500-4c6b-a860-ccc48dd69018" facs="#m-8a563181-97e3-40d9-9380-5bfd0003ab5b" label="text-like">Another Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-29bd276c-5623-433b-a51f-419b95af0b4a" facs="#m-178a30bc-9d32-4560-8480-9ed8afb2e1f1" label="lyrics-like">Ndulgéntiam nobis, quaésumus tis, *et tuae professióne virtútis.</l><l xml:id="m-676c274d-4644-409d-b617-a4ac3b07615f" facs="#m-8e984ffe-8f9a-4b54-9ba1-d5e88eda3fd6" label="lyrics-like">A Dómine, beáta N. Virgo et</l><l xml:id="m-bee366de-d0a3-4697-9be6-393bdcbf6484" facs="#m-449a6502-c6f9-474b-9b17-5742ea9eee64" label="lyrics-like">Per Dóminum nostrum Jesum Chri¬</l><l xml:id="m-509aabb5-784a-4d51-91fd-502e99288284" facs="#m-ce7d0700-540d-4a02-b0bb-d911ee90ea33" label="lyrics-like">Martyr implóret: t quae tibi grata</l><l xml:id="m-903e8be5-bf39-4871-8c78-bd60d27c5946" facs="#m-07e1ad91-8a34-47ae-9912-87e5e2c1a888" label="ambiguous">stum Filium tuum.</l><l xml:id="m-cd436040-d42d-4395-9741-39205fb95910" facs="#m-b5d7d952-9ddd-49c8-bdcb-3d6dd206ca27" label="lyrics-like">semper éxstitit et mérito castitá¬</l><l xml:id="m-1daa950a-76cf-446b-bff3-f097f15dafe5" facs="#m-9cb3cc9b-e454-4c8c-8faa-9a37c064bf52" label="text-like">For a Virgin not a Martyr. Prayer.</l><l xml:id="m-1712bcca-65c1-4219-8e53-a68dc10b8da6" facs="#m-9da73956-7b8a-4626-8456-958524d820b9" label="lyrics-like">Qxáudi nos Deus salutáris no-] mus; * ita piae devotiónis erudiá¬</l><l xml:id="m-8af7d63a-9754-4259-b176-219eb8720d96" facs="#m-cd21d429-a37d-479d-b4f3-f973eb23b904" label="lyrics-like">Uster: t ut sicut de beátae N.</l><l xml:id="m-6eaf7f39-7224-4f9e-8733-596cf77d1f69" facs="#m-6a6a9935-a236-4b24-b4b7-e054b2fd904c" label="lyrics-like">mur afféctu. Per Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-60b1a97d-040a-4b19-889b-424d849129c0" facs="#m-0e9e215f-5228-4322-b58c-b28448e0376c" label="lyrics-like">Virginis tuae festivitáte gaudé¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>